[38;2;124;124;124m$A_{R,r} = B_r \cap [-R, R]$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m$m(A_{R,r}) = m(B_r \cap [-R, R])$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mAs $R \to \infty$, $m(A_{R,r}) \to m(B_r) = \infty$ (since $B_r$ contains a [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mneighborhood of infinity).[0m

